## Review package

Completes the bounded RB-017 curated traps knowledge pilot.

### Evidence and validation

- canonical dataset `2026-07-pilot-v2` with 50 source-controlled occurrences;
- 50 retained Stockfish snapshots and 50 bounded Lichess Games Explorer snapshots;
- deterministic legality, normalized-FEN, identity, duplicate, provenance, lifecycle and evidence-hash validation;
